message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "DLMAX: Dynamic Linear Models in JAX"
abstract: >-
  A JAX-based framework for Dynamic Linear Models with Discount Model
  Averaging, for fitting and forecasting large panels of time series.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hollyman
    given-names: Ross
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0535-0013"
    email: hello@awenforecasting.com
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ross-h1/DLMAX"
keywords:
  - dynamic linear models
  - state space models
  - Bayesian forecasting
  - model averaging
  - JAX
  - time series
